{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>... I don\u2019t know how I ended up here \u2013 maybe I just walked through the wrong door. But one thing I know for sure: this place shouldn\u2019t exist. This is the Unplace.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>At first it seems empty: I walk through room after room, and nothing happens. And then - as if the system switches on. I tried to run, but it became clear every time: I won\u2019t be let go that easily. <strong>This place has one rule: face the trials.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/extras/dc904a64fbda37219d280d5b87607c6b.poster.avif?t=1768319132\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/extras/dc904a64fbda37219d280d5b87607c6b.webm?t=1768319132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/extras/dc904a64fbda37219d280d5b87607c6b.mp4?t=1768319132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in an otherworldly place - the Unplace.<br>It wants to play with you in many different ways, even if the price of the game is your life.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay sharp</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the nature of each trial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some challenges test your reflexes, others your focus, and others still your dexterity and nerves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake costs you the entire path</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creeping, ever-building sense of tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of unique and demanding challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world that loops back on itself \u2013 unpredictable and constantly shifting</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You can\u2019t miss it, right? Right?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726670/2fa3ed4de282402e0644e77038895bb7cd248ae5.jpg"},{"name":"Safe Space","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726670/2fa3ed4de282402e0644e77038895bb7cd248ae5.jpg"},{"name":"Some of the devs can't do that","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726670/2fa3ed4de282402e0644e77038895bb7cd248ae5.jpg"},{"name":"The Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726670/2fa3ed4de282402e0644e77038895bb7cd248ae5.jpg"},{"name":"Finally, you can rest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726670/2fa3ed4de282402e0644e77038895bb7cd248ae5.jpg"},{"name":"Did the totem fall?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726670/2fa3ed4de282402e0644e77038895bb7cd248ae5.jpg"},{"name":"Wonderland goes wrong","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726670/2fa3ed4de282402e0644e77038895bb7cd248ae5.jpg"},{"name":"Big brain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726670/2fa3ed4de282402e0644e77038895bb7cd248ae5.jpg"},{"name":"White Rabbit would be proud","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726670/2fa3ed4de282402e0644e77038895bb7cd248ae5.jpg"},{"name":"You will be baked, and then there will be cake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726670/2fa3ed4de282402e0644e77038895bb7cd248ae5.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726670?t=1768319132","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/i